{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Cover the actual Managed Instances context boundary**\n\nThis test fabricates `xRayTraceId` on a cast object, so all tests can pass even if the Managed Instances runtime exposes or resumes the header differently. Since this changes a public API specifically for that runtime, add a capacity-provider integration example/test that observes the real context through `withDurableExecution`, including a wait/resume invocation, and verifies the header reaches the extractor.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74kB9Z","finding_digest":"1efcb7332a5223ad0ccc1e6ca82d986150232a23685d53546d7c4a132b58b10b","finding_id":"arf_v1_d36lomzkkir22dgmdzwkqlmymf","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/lmi-header-carrier.composed.test.ts::public-wrapper-context::managed-instance-runtime-boundary","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/lmi-header-carrier.composed.test.ts::public-wrapper-context::managed-instance-runtime-boundary","line":93,"observation_digest":"1c7968658895f02763f79d9d756846c17f85bc1dd90afa9805e3e6c77847ec0b","observation_id":"aro_v1_dr4wqzmisxycoy7xtwoxk2cgyf","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/lmi-header-carrier.composed.test.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T22:02:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_goxjklhn4sz5jvoeqrstgfytmp","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"8b7ee256b98ea8a96204769f7619a657ce68b301","reviewer":"codex","start_line":89,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":955},"record_id":"art_v1_opcywm4hoob772khrqhlai646i","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T22:02:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
